            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kait624"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Taste good, but didn't turn out too great @ all. They were flat as pancakes...actually even flatter. Regardless of using cooking spray on the pan...they were glued to the pan. I had to pry them off in chunks. I didn't end up w/ a single whole cookie. Threw them all in a bowl and just grab chunks here and there to eat. I dunno what's wrong w/ this recipe, but it def didn't work!",
